{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:51:59+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:51:59+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"UBS Group AG","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Diversified","country":"Switzerland","city":"Zurich","website":"https://www.ubs.com","employees":103177,"summary":"UBS Group AG operates as a wealth manager and bank worldwide. It operates through five segments: Global Wealth Management, Personal & Corporate Banking, Asset Management, Investment Bank, and Non-Core and Legacy. The Global Wealth Management segment offers financial services, advice, and solutions; investment management, estate planning, and corporate advice services; and wealth management and banking products and services to private wealth and institutional customers. Its Personal & Corporate Banking segment provides banking, retirement, financing, investments, and strategic transactions to private, corporate, and institutional customers through its branch network and digital channels in Switzerland. The Asset Management segment offers diversified asset management services. Its Investment Bank segment provides equities, foreign exchange, precious metals, research, advisory, and capital markets services to institutional, corporate, financial sponsor, and Global Wealth Management customers, as well as focused rates and credit platform. The company also offers lending products, such as securities-based lending, mortgages, structured products, and tailored solutions; collateralized lending residential and commercial real estate, primarily against securities, residential and commercial real estate, other real assets (such as ships and aircraft), private market and hedge fund interest; and unsecured lending. The company was formerly known as UBS AG and changed its name to UBS Group AG in December 2014. UBS Group AG was founded in 1862 and is headquartered in Zurich, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"UBS Group AG exerce ses activités en tant que gestionnaire de fortune et banque dans le monde entier. Elle opère à travers cinq segments : Global Wealth Management, Personal & Corporate Banking, Asset Management, Investment Bank et Non-Core and Legacy. Le segment Global Wealth Management offre des services financiers, des conseils et des solutions, des services de gestion de placements, de planification successorale et de conseil aux entreprises, ainsi que des produits et services bancaires et de gestion de patrimoine à des clients privés et institutionnels."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":120331460608,"shares_outstanding":3030255878,"trailing_pe":16.477177,"forward_pe":11.170653,"price_to_book":1.6510018,"ev_to_ebitda":null,"ev_to_revenue":null,"dividend_yield":0.0224,"payout_ratio":0.363,"beta_yahoo":null},"targets":{"current_price":39.71,"mean":44.75824,"median":44.0,"high":60.0,"low":33.99,"n_analysts":17,"reco_mean":2.47059,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-28"],"eps_avg":0.697,"eps_low":0.697,"eps_high":0.697,"revenue_avg":10784732000,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-21","dividend_date":"2025-04-17"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00063,"institutions_pct":0.51249003,"institutions_float_pct":0.51282,"institutions_n":1431,"institutions":[{"name":"UBS Group AG","pct":0.0309,"shares":107137265,"value":4254420695,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0023},{"name":"Vanguard Capital Management LLC","pct":0.028299998,"shares":98080411,"value":3894773031,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0084},{"name":"NORGES BANK","pct":0.0277,"shares":95849980,"value":3806202618,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.087},{"name":"Fisher Asset Management, LLC","pct":0.0188,"shares":64920294,"value":2577984815,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0175},{"name":"Massachusetts Financial Services Co.","pct":0.0182,"shares":62927553,"value":2498853072,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0399},{"name":"Wellington Management Group, L